# Electron Forge (@electron-forge/cli check-system.ts) refuses to package a pnpm
# project unless `node-linker=hoisted` OR a custom `hoist-pattern` /
# `public-hoist-pattern` is defined. We deliberately keep pnpm's default
# *isolated* (symlinked) node_modules: forge.config.ts's makeNodeModulesPortable
# flattens the symlinked `.pnpm` store into the MSI itself and depends on that
# store existing, so switching to node-linker=hoisted would break packaging.
#
# Declaring the DEFAULT hoist pattern (`*`) explicitly satisfies Forge's preflight
# (`pnpm config get hoist-pattern` then returns `*`, not `undefined`) WITHOUT
# changing the resolved install layout — so `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`
# stays green and the lockfile is unaffected.
hoist-pattern[]=*
